    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "LONDON\nDONG KINGMAN",
      "Cocktailo\nSherry Dubonnet Campari\nManhattan Gin Martini Vodka Martini\nVermouth\nBloody Mary Screwdriver Whiskey Sour\nTom Collins Vodka Collins Daiquiri Scotch Bourbon\nCanadian Gin Vodka Rum Premium Beer\nMenus\nApéritif\nHors d'Oeuvre Gastronomiques\nSelected gourmet delicacies\nRoast au Vol\nA selected cut of aged beef\nroasted on board and carved to order\nGrenadins de Veau aux Chanterelles\nSauteéd veal escalopes with fresh forest mushrooms\nPoulet Smitane\nSupreme of young pullet in a spritely brown sauce\nwith a hint of sour cream\nPaupiettes de Sole Printanière\nDelicate wine poached sole fillets with a julienne of fresh vegetables\nPlat du Jour\nSpeciality of the dav\nPommes de Terre Maison\nPotatoes Maison",
      "Poulet Smitane\nSupreme of young pullet in a spritely brown sauce\nwith a hint of sour cream\nPaupiettes de Sole Printanière\nDelicate wine poached sole fillets with a julienne of fresh vegetables\nPlat du Jour\nSpeciality of the day\nPommes de Terre Maison\nPotatoes Maison\nLégumes au Beurre\nButtered vegetable bouquet\nSalade Campagnarde\nTossed garden salad\nSélection de Fruits et Fromages\nSelected fruits and cheeses\nDessert\nCafé\nCoffee\nCafé Décaféiné\nDecaffeinated Coffee\nTea\nSelected Red and White Wines\nChampagne Brut\nDrambuie\nBénédictine Crème de Menthe\nCognac Napoléon Contreau\nKahlúa\nAmaretto di Saronno\n266 K",
      "LONDON\nDong Kingman, the award winning Chinese-American artist, travels the world sketching and painting\nthe beautiful, the monumental and the picturesque. His watercolors grace more than forty\npermanent museum and private collections in the USA and abroad\nThis view of the Thames embankment and Big Ben captures some of the charm of London. Every\nstudent of history should see the Houses of Parliament, Buckingham Palace, Westminster Abbey, and\nthe Tower of London. While it is one of the world's great centers of commerce, it is also a city of\nbeauty with extensive parks and gardens. The luxurious Inter-Continental London is situated adjacent\nto gracious Hyde Park and the Portman Inter-Continental Hotel is conveniently located at One,\nPortman Square. Pan Am serves London every day on its Round-The-World flights and one can reach\nLondon on Pan Am from virtually anywhere in the world.\nPAN AM\n2001.080. 256"
    ],
